          <button onclick="document.getElementById('modal-faq-1').close()" class="absolute top-4 right-4 bg-stone-100 hover:bg-stone-200 text-stone-900 p-2 rounded-full transition-colors z-10" aria-label="Close modal">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"/></svg>
          </button>
          
          <div class="flex items-start mb-6 pr-8">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl mr-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-1">Q</div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-stone-900 leading-tight">How often should I service my garage door?</h3>
          </div>
          
          <div class="prose prose-stone max-w-none mb-8">
            <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed font-semibold mb-4 text-lg">We recommend scheduling a professional garage door tune-up and inspection at least once a year.</p>
            <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Your garage door is likely the largest and heaviest moving part of your home. It goes through thousands of opening and closing cycles annually. Over time, the constant tension, vibration, and temperature fluctuations can cause hardware to loosen, springs to fatigue, and tracks to misalign.</p>
            <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">A standard annual maintenance visit includes:</p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-stone-600 mb-4 list-disc pl-5">
              <li><strong>Spring Tension Calibration:</strong> Ensuring the door remains perfectly balanced so the motor doesn't burn out prematurely.</li>
              <li><strong>Roller & Hinge Lubrication:</strong> Eliminating grinding noises and reducing friction using specialized non-stick lithium or silicone sprays.</li>
              <li><strong>Safety Sensor Alignment:</strong> Critical for preventing the door from closing on vehicles, pets, or people.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">Catching these mechanical issues early during an annual tune-up can save you hundreds of dollars in emergency repair costs and significantly extend the lifespan of your automatic opener.</p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 p-6 rounded-xl flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-6">
            <p class="text-stone-800 font-semibold text-center sm:text-left">Time for your annual tune-up?</p>
            <a href="#contact" onclick="document.getElementById('modal-faq-1').close()" class="w-full sm:w-auto text-center bg-amber-700 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg shadow-md hover:bg-amber-800 transition-colors">Schedule Service</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </dialog>

      <!-- FAQ Modal 2 -->
