            <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed font-semibold mb-4 text-lg">Absolutely. We are comprehensive access control experts, handling both residential driveway gates and heavy-duty commercial security gates.</p>
            <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">A malfunctioning gate can compromise your property's security and become a massive inconvenience. Whether your motor is burnt out, the track is bent, or the logic board is failing due to weather exposure, we can diagnose and repair the issue promptly.</p>
            <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Our gate operator services include:</p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-stone-600 mb-4 list-disc pl-5">
              <li><strong>Swing & Slide Gate Motors:</strong> We service and install top brands engineered for extreme weather, heavy usage, and longevity.</li>
              <li><strong>Smart Access Control:</strong> We can upgrade your system to include Wi-Fi-enabled smartphone control (like MyQ), digital keypads, telephone entry intercoms, and magnetic vehicle exit wands.</li>
              <li><strong>Solar-Powered Solutions:</strong> For remote driveway gates where running high-voltage electrical lines is too expensive, we install efficient solar-powered motors with deep-cycle battery backups.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          
          <div class="bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 p-6 rounded-xl flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-6">
            <p class="text-stone-800 font-semibold text-center sm:text-left">Looking to automate your gate?</p>
            <a href="#contact" onclick="document.getElementById('modal-faq-3').close()" class="w-full sm:w-auto text-center bg-amber-700 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg shadow-md hover:bg-amber-800 transition-colors">Request a Quote</a>
          </div>
        </div>
